\section{Scheduling}

Task is to generate and follow an optimal parallelized execution plan. It will take in the following data
\begin{itemize}
  \item An acylic digraph detailing where execution order matters
  \item An undirected graph detailing which systems cannot be run at the same time
  \item An estimate of the execution time of each system that will be derived from profiling
\end{itemize}
