\section{API for Wasm interface}

Task is to produce usable metadata for compilation and expose public functions to wasmtime's linker with a relatively easy to use API on the Rust end of the engine. My thinking for this is that it will most likely come in the form of a series of proc macros and a build script that actually generates all of this.

