\section{Memory Management}

Task is to figure out how to handle allocating the data in the ECS World. Needs to meet the following requirements:
\begin{itemize}
  \item memory is stored such that it is optimized for ECS/Data-Oriented Design (i.e. optimal-ish cache locality)
  \item efficient arena allocation for batched deallocation of scenes as well as allowing scenes to be loaded in the background
  \item there is a concrete strategy for efficiently handling the transfer of data too and from the GPU for shaders
    \subitem i.e. determine what should live on the GPU, how and when data should be transferred to and from the GPU, etc.
\end{itemize}

