\section{ECS Queries}

Task is to enable querying from the ECS in a manner that produces the most efficient canonical implementations of any given problem. Needs to meet the following requirements:
\begin{itemize}
  \item Produces useful data on system dependencies
  \item Have a relatively intutive syntax
  \item Produces (relatively) optimal query execution plans
  \item Uses some form of caching to avoid unnecessarily performing the same computation multiple times
  \item Allows the end-user to query components through multiple data-structures (e.g. Spatial Hashes, Vectors, etc.)
    \subitem Ideally, the end-user should be able to define said data-structures themselves
\end{itemize}

