\section{Scripting Language}

Task is to design a scripting language for the end user to be able to write systems and similar in. Requirements are:
\begin{itemize}
  \item Needs to be able to compile to Wasm
  \item A simple borrow checking schema (could possibly do something closer to RAII-style scoped memory management)
  \item Needs to be able to distinguish mutable and immutable references
  \item Needs both high and low-level ways of performing various tasks
  \item Needs to integrate into ECS Queries, Memory Management, etc.
  \item Needs to be able to link to runtime functions and, ideally, arbitrary dynamic libraries
  \item Try to prioritize zero-cost abstraction, model semantics off of Rust
  \item Should have traits
  \item Ideally in the future should have good metaprogramming support
\end{itemize}

